WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:02.923
Unit one. Balanced Diet!

2
00:00:03.874 --> 00:00:07.371
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.421 --> 00:00:11.035
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:14.622
Today we learn about Balanced Diet. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.507 --> 00:00:19.557
Macronutrient. Say it with me. Macronutrient!

6
00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:27.194
Carbohydrate. Say it with me. Carbohydrate!

7
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.273
Protein. Say it with me. Protein!

8
00:00:37.781 --> 00:00:41.048
Fat. Say it with me. Fat!

9
00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:48.722
Portion control. Say it with me. Portion control!

10
00:00:52.207 --> 00:00:56.174
Meal planning. Say it with me. Meal planning!

11
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.733
Moderation. Say it with me. Moderation!

12
00:01:07.231 --> 00:01:11.398
Whole foods. Say it with me. Whole foods!

13
00:01:14.894 --> 00:01:26.971
A balanced diet includes the right macronutrients: carbohydrate, protein, and fat. Portion control and meal planning help me eat in moderation. I try to choose whole foods over processed snacks.

14
00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:28.297
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:34.703
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.753 --> 00:01:35.903
Protein!

17
00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:42.293
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.343 --> 00:01:43.560
Moderation!

19
00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:51.866
Did you know? Carbohydrates are your body's main source of quick energy, especially for your brain!

20
00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.486 --> 00:02:02.238
Think and answer. What does a balanced meal look like to you?

22
00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.438
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.603 --> 00:02:09.387
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.437 --> 00:02:12.043
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

